REM plan-81 IMPORT self runtime proof. `self_fanout_workers::runFanout` spawns two
REM self-workers from WITHIN that package via `self::bump`. Each worker runs a fresh
REM isolated instance of the package: it sees COUNTER start at its declared 7,
REM mutates only its own arena copy (so the two results are 107 and 207, proving the
REM workers do not share state with each other), and the package instance in this
REM parent thread keeps COUNTER = 7 (proving the worker writes are not shared with
REM the parent). `counter()` read here confirms the parent's 7 once more.

IMPORT io
IMPORT self_fanout_workers

FUNC main AS Integer
  io::print(self_fanout_workers::runFanout())
  io::print("main_counter=" & toString(self_fanout_workers::counter()))
  RETURN 0
END FUNC
